OL,3,GNEWSASevern Trent sorry after thousands
OL,4,Awithout water
OL,5,
OL,6,FA water company has apologised for
OL,7,Fleaving thousands of homes and
OL,8,Fbusinesses without running water for an
OL,9,F"unacceptable" period of time.
OL,11,FIn a statement Severn Trent Water boss
OL,12,FJames Jesic said he was "deeply sorry"
OL,13,Fthe company was not able to identify
OL,14,Fthe source of a major leak in
OL,15,FStourbridge sooner.
OL,17,FThe water company said a large fallen
OL,18,Ftree caused significant damage to one
OL,19,Fof its major water pipes in a
OL,20,Fdifficult-to-access rural location,
OL,21,Fwhich resulted in more than 8,500
OL,22,Fproperties losing supply on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
