OL,3,GNEWSASevern Trent sorry after thousands
OL,4,Awithout water
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Being without water for this length of
OL,7,Ftime is simply unacceptable, and I'm
OL,8,Fdeeply sorry we weren't able to restore
OL,9,Fyour supply sooner," said Jesic.
